/*
  TeslaApiRefTool.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0020 · TeslaApiRefTool (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `TeslaApiRefTool` resolves (table "TeslaApiRefTool") lives here with its web
  English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master
  catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each
  parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog
  (parallel-safe across the concurrent surface slots).

  The "web source" keys are the exact t(...) keys from
  features/admin/components/devtools/tools/TeslaApiRefTool.tsx. "Method" and "Path"
  resolve to web/src/i18n/en.json; the other source keys are not present in en.json,
  so i18next echoes the key as the displayed English — reproduced verbatim here for
  parity. The remaining keys back the native chrome (search a11y, result count,
  states, banners, freshness chip) and the row VoiceOver copy.
*/

